OL,5,GUK Weather Forecast                    
OL,7,GThursday:FA mostly dry, cloudy         
OL,8,Fmorning, with northeastern showers     
OL,9,Feasing. Heavy rain and strong winds    
OL,10,Facross Northern Ireland and western    
OL,11,FScotland later. Mostly cold, slightly  
OL,12,Fmilder in the far west.                
OL,14,GOutlook for Friday to Sunday:FOn       
OL,15,FFriday, outbreaks of rain for many and 
OL,16,Fsome snow and ice for northern hills.  
OL,17,FOn Saturday, further rain and showers. 
OL,18,FA mix of sunny spells and showers on   
OL,19,FSunday.                                
