OL,4,CUS announces new tariff proposals on   
OL,5,CEU, China, and other trade partners    
OL,6,GThe US announces new tariffs on some   
OL,7,Gof its biggest trade partners,         
OL,8,Gincluding China and the European Union.
OL,10,FDifferent tariffs will apply to        
OL,11,Fdifferent countries and products -     
OL,12,FChina is facing the highest rate of    
OL,13,F"up to 40%", although the effective    
OL,14,Frate could be lower.                   
