OL,4,CUS attorney general dodges questions   
OL,5,Cabout Nvidia investigation             
OL,6,GUS Attorney General Todd Blanche has   
OL,7,Gbacked Nvidia as a "good corporate     
OL,8,Gcitizen" while refusing to comment on  
OL,9,Gwhether the AI chipmaker was under     
OL,10,Gfederal investigation.                 
OL,12,FBlanche said he had no information     
OL,13,Fabout newly reinstated CEO Jensen      
OL,14,FHuang's security clearance status, as  
OL,15,Flawmakers demand answers about US      
OL,16,FPresident Donald Trump's involvement   
OL,17,Fin Huang's comeback.                   
